$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add assets:bank:mybank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah account add assets:bank:leumi --currency ILS --opening 25000 --date 2026-10-01
Added assets:bank:leumi (ILS).

$ moolah account add liabilities:card:chase --currency USD
Added liabilities:card:chase (USD).

$ moolah account add assets:invest:pension --currency ILS --opening 380000 --date 2026-01-01
Added assets:invest:pension (ILS).

